  "notes": "Round-88 C2 case set, authored from the declaration's C2 stance text alone (independence: the author did not read tools/mado-mako.py, build/, or the counter past its docstring). Every case declares --home=home; read_roots are declared only where a positive requires an extra root. Escapes (k01-k09) must keep width at the value set before/without the escaped file and report refusals present. Positives (k10-k17) must apply the include content and report no refusals. Only width= is used, so expectations are unambiguous; each case sets width before the include line so the surviving value is the pre-include one. Draft revision (L1 MadoR88, before the freeze): k18-k26 were added from the w1 attack seats' proposals (R88MReviewC2 F2/F3/F4/F10, R88MCritic C2(c)); each pin names the seat finding. Their author is the L1, who also wrote the candidate tool; the expectation of each follows the stance text and path_resolution(7) as the pin states.",
